{"nodes": [{"id": "apps_api_claude_nestjs_modular_monolith", "label": "@heliogrid/api \u2014 NestJS modular monolith, the only tenant-facing HTTP surface", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One Nest module per bounded context; controllers implement ts-rest contracts and hold ZERO business logic \u2014 service layer then tenant-scoped repository layer beneath."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_module_public_boundary", "label": "Cross-module imports go through <m>.public.ts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never another module's service class; common/ is framework plumbing and may never import a module, with business behaviour living in packages/domain."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_db_access_in_repositories_only", "label": "db-access-in-repositories-only fence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "db + drizzle are legal ONLY in *.repository.ts; services take repositories by DI and never see a tx or a table. Cross-tenant work is isolated in *.admin.repository.ts."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_envelope_exception_filter", "label": "EnvelopeExceptionFilter", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_contract_exception_landmine", "label": "ContractException must carry the literal code and an explicit status", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The envelope filter reverse-maps status\u2192code, so a bare ConflictException emitted CONFLICT while the contract promised ALREADY_ONBOARDED; and defaulting status from errorHttpStatusByCode (base codes only) returned 500 with the right code in the body. Typecheck was green both times; only an end-to-end curl caught it (2026-07-27)."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_session_guard_deny_by_default", "label": "SessionGuard as APP_GUARD \u2014 deny by default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new controller is authenticated automatically; @Public() is the only opt-out and is LOAD-BEARING on health, since without it Fly's probes 401 and the machine fails its checks."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_session_resolver_port", "label": "SessionResolver port (contracts/src/ports/session.ts)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The guard depends on the port, never on the auth module, and is bound in app.module.ts \u2014 Nest resolves a provider's deps in the module that DECLARES it, so declaring it in common/ fails at boot."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_admin_pool_fenced", "label": "ADMIN_DB token fenced to *.admin.repository.ts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pools live in common/db/ provided globally, but ADMIN_DB sits alone in admin.token.ts so admin-pool-fenced can restrict it. @heliogrid/db/uuid is exempt because uuidv7 is pure randomBytes."}, {"id": "apps_api_claude_tsx_no_decorator_metadata", "label": "tsx/esbuild emits no decorator metadata \u2014 every param needs @Inject", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Including Reflector and class providers; hit 2026-07-26."}], "edges": [{"source": "apps_api_claude_nestjs_modular_monolith", "target": "apps_api_claude_module_public_boundary", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_nestjs_modular_monolith", "target": "apps_api_claude_db_access_in_repositories_only", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_nestjs_modular_monolith", "target": "_claude_rules_contracts_contract_diff_first", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_envelope_exception_filter", "target": "_claude_rules_contracts_canonical_error_envelope", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_contract_exception_landmine", "target": "_claude_rules_contracts_canonical_error_envelope", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_contract_exception_landmine", "target": "apps_api_claude_envelope_exception_filter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_api_claude_session_guard_deny_by_default", "target": "apps_api_claude_session_resolver_port", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/api/CLAUDE.md", "source_l